 source predicates and frozen evidence: [the preserved profile-interface context](plan.md#platform-source-context), mapping hardware/clock-reset-contract; all attached contextual and negative predicates remain required. No implementation acceptance is inferred. Criterion profile-gap/hardware/compartment-boundary (Open): Input: Capability-hardware compartment crossing with compartment IDs, sealed entry/call gates, call/return authority, bounded shared state and transferred-capability lifetime/revocation assumptions. Accept: Validate the explicit authority transfer, legal entry and return paths and permitted sharing/lifetime assumptions at each crossing. Reject: Implicit sharing through wires/debug/untyped maps, undeclared entry or return authority, invalid sealed state and omitted shared-memory/lifetime rules. Required outputs: Compartment/authority-transfer and temporal-assumption report, sealed-entry/call/return/shared-state positive/negative cases and P8-COMPARTMENT boundary/origin/metadata diagnostics. Dependencies: legality/remaining-tasks-and-evidence/complete-profile-restrictions-and-generated-form-checks, backend-hdl interface facts, not whole-task completion. Exact source predicates and frozen evidence: [the preserved profile-interface context](plan.md#platform-source-context), mapping hardware/compartment-boundary; all attached contextual and negative predicates remain required. No implementation acceptance is inferred. Criterion profile-gap/hardware/external-port-contract (Open): Input: Hardware port or bus with direction, fixed width, protocol/ready-valid behavior, timing, reset and capability boundary; tag lanes/metadata permissions for capability-bearing interfaces. Accept: Validate the complete external protocol and target shape, allowed permission transitions, compartment status and debug/DMA/bridge capability-observation/destruction rules; preserve interface source/target metadata. Reject: Untyped/incomplete ports, protocol violations, missing timing/reset/capability evidence and undeclared metadata destruction or authority transfer. Required outputs: Port/bus/interface manifest, protocol acceptance/rejection fixtures and P8-PORT/capability diagnostics with signal/module/domain/origin/target context. Dependencies: types/current-evidence-and-remaining-work/types2-check-declared-abstractions, legality/remaining-tasks-and-evidence/complete-profile-restrictions-and-generated-form-checks, backend-hdl interface facts, not whole-task completion. Exact source predicates and frozen evidence: [the preserved profile-interface context](plan.md#platform-source-context), mapping hardware/external-port-contract; all attached contextual and negative predicates remain required. No implementation acceptance is inferred. Criterion profile-gap/hardware/state-machine-contract (Open): Input: Hardware state-machine declaration with state type, initial state, transition function, inputs/outputs, reset, illegal-state behavior and required coverage/assertion hooks. Accept: Construct the state graph and separately validate initial/reset/transition/output/illegal-state semantics; retain explicit state and hook identities for verification and diagnostics. Reject: Malformed state/transition/initial/reset or unspecified illegal-state behavior; graph emission alone cannot pass legality. Required outputs: State-machine graph, accepted transition/reset/output fixtures, rejected invalid-state cases, source-mapped verification/diagnostic and required assertion/coverage records. Dependencies: legality/remaining-tasks-and-evidence/complete-profile-restrictions-and-generated-form-checks, backend-hdl interface facts, not whole-task completion. Exact source predicates and frozen evidence: [the preserved profile-interface context](plan.md#platform-source-context), mapping hardware/state-machine-contract; all attached contextual and negative predicates remain required. No implementation acceptance is inferred. Criterion profile-gap/hardware/structural-p