aim. These target gates do not require completion of the full Platform Product.. Criterion `domain/firmware-image-production`: Produce target-specific firmware images with explicit startup/memory/section/BSP boundaries, source/audit/link maps and required boot evidence. Accepted fixture: Emit firmware with target memory map, startup/reset, vectors, stack/static allocation/sections, panic and BSP boundaries. Negative fixture: Reject incomplete startup/layout, unsupported hosted services, unaudited MMIO or absent boot evidence. Required evidence: firmware image, source/link/audit maps and boot/simulator report; bind source/compiler/profile/target/provider identities, source-mapped stable diagnostics and every applicable source facet field/exception/negative condition listed for this criterion in [the full preserved Domain context](plan.md#platform-source-context). Dependencies consume backend-c, runtime/remaining-tasks-and-evidence/implement-explicit-family-selection-and-no-runtime-rejection outputs under their stated contracts; no whole-component completion prerequisite. Status: Open; implementation acceptance unassessed. Criterion `domain/firmware-sensor-integration`: Execute the declared timer-driven sensor firmware slice and reject forbidden MMIO/interrupt/runtime use. Accepted fixture: Run timer-driven sensor reset, interrupt acknowledgement, ADC schema, static buffer writes and panic behavior on a named substrate. Negative fixture: Reject forbidden MMIO/interrupt/runtime use and undeclared effects or allocation policy. Required evidence: sensor firmware image, vector/link records and simulator trace; bind source/compiler/profile/target/provider identities, source-mapped stable diagnostics and every applicable source facet field/exception/negative condition listed for this criterion in [the full preserved Domain context](plan.md#platform-source-context). Dependencies consume backend-c, runtime/remaining-tasks-and-evidence/implement-explicit-family-selection-and-n